<title>USA: American ATM  acquires ATM units.</title>
<headline>American ATM  acquires ATM units.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American ATM Corp said on Monday that it will acquire 35 automated teller machine (ATM) units and lease agreements on another 16 ATMs from Diebold Inc for 30,000 shares of common stock plus incentives.</p>
<p>It said the deal is valued at over $200,000. The deal would double its current operations, American ATM said.</p>
<p>The ATMs being acquired are currently in well established East coast locations from Maine to Florida, the company said.</p>
</text>
